{"id":11120,"date":"2022-12-16T12:30:19","date_gmt":"2022-12-16T12:30:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=11120"},"modified":"2022-12-19T13:56:24","modified_gmt":"2022-12-19T13:56:24","slug":"timegate-ramanovy-spektrometry-s-realnym-potlacenim-fluorescence","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/timegate-ramanovy-spektrometry-s-realnym-potlacenim-fluorescence\/","title":{"rendered":"Timegate: Ramanovy spektrometry s re\u00e1ln\u00fdm potla\u010den\u00edm fluorescence"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>V\u00e1\u017een\u00ed u\u017eivatel\u00e9! R\u00e1di bychom v\u00e1m p\u0159edstavili <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/modelova-rada\/raman\/timegate\/\"><strong>Ramanovy spektrometry Timegate<\/strong><\/a>, kter\u00e9 jsou d\u00edky patentovan\u00e9 technologii <a href=\"https:\/\/www.timegate.com\/products\"><strong>Timegated<\/strong><\/a> vybaven\u00e9 re\u00e1ln\u00fdm potla\u010den\u00edm fluorescence.<\/p>\n<p>Ramanova spektroskopie je velmi siln\u00fdm n\u00e1strojem ka\u017ed\u00e9 modern\u00ed laborato\u0159e. Je to rychl\u00e1, spolehliv\u00e1, jednoduch\u00e1 a relativn\u011b levn\u00e1 analytick\u00e1 metoda, kter\u00e1 nevy\u017eaduje hlubok\u00e9 spektroskopick\u00e9 znalosti ani slo\u017eitou p\u0159\u00edpravu vzorku. B\u011bhem n\u011bkolika des\u00edtek vte\u0159in poskytuje detailn\u00ed informace o chemick\u00e9m slo\u017een\u00ed vzorku, jeho krystalick\u00e9 struktu\u0159e i fyzik\u00e1ln\u00edch vlastnostech. Je mo\u017en\u00e9 s n\u00ed m\u011b\u0159it mikroskopick\u00e9 vzorky i rozm\u011brn\u00e9 objekty, a Ramanova spektra lze m\u011b\u0159it dokonce i p\u0159es \u0159adu obalov\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f. Na probl\u00e9my ov\u0161em nar\u00e1\u017e\u00ed v p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b fluorescence, kter\u00e1 m\u016f\u017ee n\u011bkter\u00e1 m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed zkomplikovat, nebo i zcela znemo\u017enit, co\u017e je \u010dast\u00e9 nap\u0159. u vzork\u016f biologick\u00e9ho p\u016fvodu \u010di barevn\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f. To se hod\u00ed ve farmaceutick\u00e9m, biochemick\u00e9m, biologick\u00e9m \u010di materi\u00e1lov\u00e9m v\u00fdzkumu, v pr\u016fmyslov\u00e9 v\u00fdrob\u011b \u0159ady odv\u011btv\u00ed, p\u0159i v\u00fdvoji nov\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f a dal\u0161\u00edch oborech.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_11125\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-11125\" style=\"width: 460px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-11125\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/c1391eef-300x150.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"460\" height=\"230\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/c1391eef-300x150.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/c1391eef-1024x512.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/c1391eef-768x384.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/c1391eef-1536x768.png 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/12\/c1391eef.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 460px) 100vw, 460px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-11125\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Raman\u016fv spektrometr <a href=\"https:\/\/www.timegate.com\/products?hsLang=en\"><strong>Picoraman M3<\/strong><\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Existuje \u0159ada zp\u016fsob\u016f, jak s fluorescenc\u00ed bojovat, z nich\u017e ka\u017ed\u00fd m\u00e1 sv\u00e9 v\u00fdhody i nev\u00fdhody. Spole\u010dnost Timegate v\u0161ak jako prvn\u00ed nab\u00edz\u00ed jedine\u010dn\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed re\u00e1ln\u00e9ho potla\u010den\u00ed fluorescence, a tak je s jej\u00edmi spektrometry mo\u017en\u00e9 m\u011b\u0159it i vzorky, jejich\u017e anal\u00fdza s b\u011b\u017en\u00fdmi spektrometry nebyla mo\u017en\u00e1 nebo byla nep\u0159im\u011b\u0159en\u011b komplikovan\u00e1. Sv\u00e9 uplatn\u011bn\u00ed p\u0159\u00edstroje Timegate nal\u00e9zaj\u00ed nap\u0159\u00edklad:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.timegate.com\/biopharmacy?hsLang=en\">v biofarmaceutick\u00e9m pr\u016fmyslu<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.timegate.com\/pharmaceutical-industry?hsLang=en\">ve farmaceutick\u00e9m pr\u016fmyslu,<\/a> kde m\u016f\u017eou nahradit nap\u0159. fluorometry<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.timegate.com\/research\">v \u0159ad\u011b v\u00fdzkumn\u00fdch obor\u016f<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=6O_TIbAh9BA&amp;t=115s\">v pr\u016fmyslov\u00fdch provozech<\/a><\/li>\n<li><strong>v\u0161ude tam, kde va\u0161i pr\u00e1ci komplikuje fluorescence<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>V\u00e1\u017een\u00ed u\u017eivatel\u00e9! R\u00e1di bychom v\u00e1m p\u0159edstavili Ramanovy spektrometry Timegate, kter\u00e9 jsou d\u00edky patentovan\u00e9 technologii Timegated vybaven\u00e9 re\u00e1ln\u00fdm potla\u010den\u00edm fluorescence. Ramanova spektroskopie je velmi siln\u00fdm n\u00e1strojem ka\u017ed\u00e9 modern\u00ed laborato\u0159e. Je to rychl\u00e1, spolehliv\u00e1, jednoduch\u00e1 a relativn\u011b levn\u00e1 analytick\u00e1 metoda, kter\u00e1 nevy\u017eaduje hlubok\u00e9 spektroskopick\u00e9 znalosti ani slo\u017eitou p\u0159\u00edpravu vzorku. B\u011bhem n\u011bkolika des\u00edtek vte\u0159in poskytuje detailn\u00ed informace o [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":11139,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[109,9],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-11120","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-109","category-novinky"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Timegate: Ramanovy spektrometry s re\u00e1ln\u00fdm potla\u010den\u00edm fluorescence - Nicolet CZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/